OS-ETC-IRIDIS is a fork of IRIDIS by WWRJ3321 (https://github.com/WWRJ3321/IRIDIS).
All original authorship, copyright and credits are preserved; the ETC fork adds:
  - armeabi-v7a (32-bit) builds for lite and full flavours,
  - 32-bit proot / Alpine (armv7) support for the built-in Linux terminal,
  - ABI-aware engine handling (LiteRT-LM remains 64-bit only),
  - new OS-ETC-IRIDIS branding and icon.

